## Import

`{{ .Name }}` can be imported with the integration type and the integration's ID in SELECT:

```bash
terraform import {{ .Name }}.email email/2f1c8b4e-9a6d-4d1f-9d0e-7d3a5b6c8e01
```

The import fails when the integration is not of the given type. Usually an import is not necessary: a create adopts the organization's existing integration.
